  "description": "Laning discipline for the match AI before 10:00: a champion below 40% health with an enemy near, or outnumbered, stops hitting enemy champions and backs off behind its nearest tower; nobody hits a champion standing under its own tower. A kill stays on (target at 25% health or less, 10% under its tower). Farming, roaming, objectives and skills aimed at a spot are untouched, and everything after 10:00. Log: league_lane.log.\n\n对线纪律（10:00 前）：生命低于 40% 且身边有敌人、或以少打多时，不再打英雄，退到自家最近的塔后；谁也不打站在自家塔下的英雄。能拿人头时照打（目标 25% 以下，塔下要 10% 以下）。补兵、游走、打资源、放向地面的技能都不管，10:00 以后也不管。日志 league_lane.log。",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-08",
  "mod_id": "league_lane",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: laning discipline (calmer laning before 10:00)",
  "version": "0.1.4"
}